of these fine art photographs.

106
00:07:48,761 --> 00:07:51,800
And, to the frustration of many architects, the budget.

107
00:07:51,801 --> 00:07:54,400
Even if it has nothing to do mechanical, just so you know.

108
00:07:54,401 --> 00:07:58,080
The architect also consults a series of additional specialists,

109
00:07:58,081 --> 00:07:59,840
like the structural engineer,

110
00:07:59,841 --> 00:08:03,020
