113
00:08:06,961 --> 00:08:11,460
Architecture is like watching a child grow.

114
00:08:11,461 --> 00:08:13,920
A parent can want them to go this way,

115
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:16,440
maybe a little bit this way,

116
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,380
