00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:03,720
Before the Caltrans building or any large building can go up, it's got to go down.

127
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:08,620
More than a cliche, creating a solid foundation is essential.

128
00:09:16,380 --> 00:09:19,660
This building will be supported on spread footings.

129
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:24,760
Spread footings are basically a rectangular or square concrete block,

130
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:28,720
