132
00:09:31,561 --> 00:09:38,560
The Caltrans steel superstructure will weigh 13,000 tons.

133
00:09:38,561 --> 00:09:42,560
But fortunately, rock near the surface can carry the load.

134
00:09:42,561 --> 00:09:45,560
When a site has mud, soft soil, or weak rock,

135
00:09:45,561 --> 00:09:48,560
a builder might have to drive piles,

136
00:09:48,561 --> 00:09:53,560
pounding long pieces of concrete or steel down to bedrock.

137
00:09:53,561 --> 00:09:57,560
Piles won't be necessary for the Caltrans building.

138
00:09:57,561 --> 00:10:00,560
But before concrete pouring for the footings can begin,

139
00:10:00,561 --> 00:10:03,560
