154
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:48,960
Here, a backhoe becomes a time machine.

155
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:52,040
Some of the interesting fossils that we have found

156
00:10:52,041 --> 00:10:54,340
have been great white teeth.

157
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:57,080
This is a fossil great white shark.

158
00:10:57,560 --> 00:11:02,900
approximately three million years old. But a big find is often the last thing a

159
00:11:02,901 --> 00:11:09,320
construction company wants when they're fighting a deadline. One of the biggest

160
00:11:09,321 --> 00:11:14,900
construction related finds happened in 1991 during excavation for a new federal

161
00:11:14,901 --> 00:11:20,240
building in lower Manhattan. Builders uncovered hundreds of burials from an

162
00:11:20,241 --> 00:11:25,400
African cemetery, halting construction for several months while archaeologists

163
00:11:25,401 --> 00:11:31,440
excavated the remains. It's essentially like a big treasure

164
00:11:31,441 --> 00:11:34,654
hunt. That's what keeps the drive and the interest going.

165
00:11:34,655 --> 00:11:36,740
You're going to find that one awesome

166
00:11:36,741 --> 00:11:42,720
site that's going to make you famous. Even at the excavation stage, this project

167
00:11:42,721 --> 00:11:46,392
takes an enormous amount of planning and coordination.

168
00:11:46,393 --> 00:11:49,180
That's where the general contractor comes

169
00:11:49,181 --> 00:11:52,180
On this project, that's Clark Construction.

170
00:11:52,181 --> 00:11:54,180
It's miscellaneous items.

171
00:11:54,181 --> 00:11:56,180
We, no personal vehicles on site.

172
00:11:56,181 --> 00:11:59,180
Everybody can tell the site's pretty congested and we don't want to...

173
00:11:59,181 --> 00:12:02,180
Clark's job is to coordinate the subcontractors,

174
00:12:02,181 --> 00:12:07,180
to schedule the work, and to make sure it meshes as smoothly as possible.

175
00:12:07,181 --> 00:12:12,180
There are more than 55 subcontractors who will actually do the construction.

176
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:18,180
The general contractor oversees this organized chaos.

