202
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:45,980
Obviously, a building needs to be rented or leased or used,

203
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:48,520
and the user needs to know when he's coming in,

204
00:13:48,980 --> 00:13:51,400
and it costs money to rent the building someplace else,

205
00:13:51,460 --> 00:13:53,720
so this building has to be done on time.

206
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:57,640
We will be on schedule no matter what it takes.

207
00:13:57,641 --> 00:13:58,720
We will make it happen.

